# mindone 12.09 (F4136): android.hardware.media.c2@1.2-mediatek (domain mediacodec) reads
# the generic PLATFORM context default_prop (1 read/open/getattr/map denial per boot,
# device/logs/catch-0911-185910/dmesg.txt.gz) - the same class of restriction as mtk_hal_camera.te/
# mtk_hal_c2.te (AOSP neverallow, allow breaks the build - F3908). dontaudit is safe for
# enforcing and grants no permission.
dontaudit mediacodec default_prop:file { read open getattr map };
